# Revision History

## Rev 1.2.1A (Current)

Current production revision.

Changes include:

- Increased terminal block drill diameter from 0.8 mm to 1.0 mm
- Improved compatibility with commercially available 2.54 mm screw terminal blocks
- White solder mask
- Black silkscreen
- Minor documentation updates

Status:
🟡 In fabrication

